#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-SEND-9433 expect=noViolation domain=TP
# Rule:Description: CDISC-SEND-9433 — the Required key RSTGCD is not populated.
#note "RSTGCD populated -> noViolation; the twin scenario differs only in the value of RSTGCD."
#library standard=sendig-dart version=1-1
dataset TP
col STUDYID type=Char
col DOMAIN type=Char
col TPSEQ type=Char
col RSTGCD type=Char
col RSTG type=Char
---
S1      | TP     | 1     | F0     | F0 Generation
---
